   "body": "## Summary\r\n\r\nThis _should_ fix the CI failures we're seeing with sdist installs of `uv-build`.\r\n\r\nThe TL;DR is that GitHub's default runner image contains Rust 1.92, which is behind our MSRV (1.93 as of two days ago). Eventually they'll catch up, but in the mean time we should always enforce the toolchain version.\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n\r\nSee if the CI goes green.",
